1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,360
Reading, my best friend Teenagers Magazine has received many articles from students about their best friends.

2
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:15,710
Here are two of them.

3
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:22,670
Betty, my best friend, is a slim girl, with big bright eyes.

4
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:29,430
Her hair is longer than mine and she usually wears it in a ponytail.

5
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:35,580
Kind and helpful, Betty is ready to help anyone, anytime.

6
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:45,020
She always gives up her seat on the bus to someone in need and she often helps us with our homework.

7
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:48,130
Betty is also trustworthy.

8
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:52,730
When something worries me, I always go to her.

9
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:58,400
She listens to me carefully and understands me quite well.

10
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,720
She knows how to cheer me up when I am feeling down.

11
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:09,430
Betty is the most wonderful friend in my life.

12
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:13,400
My best friend is Max.

13
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:20,800
He is the tallest boy in our class, almost 1.8 metres tall.

14
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:24,250
He wears small round glasses.

15
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:27,610
They make him look a little bit funny.

16
00:01:27,610 --> 00:01:30,770
Max has a great sense of humour.

17
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:34,890
He often tells jokes and makes us laugh.

18
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:38,820
You will never feel bored with him around.

19
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:42,060
Max is always full of energy.

20
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:47,150
He stays active by doing sport and other club activities.

21
00:01:47,150 --> 00:01:49,870
He never gets tired.

22
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:52,670
Max is also cheerful.

23
00:01:52,670 --> 00:02:02,280
Sometimes I want to give up on difficult tasks, but he always tells me, keep trying, you can do it.

24
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,710
That means a lot to me.

25
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:08,540
I believe we will be best friends for life.
